body: "## Fresh review inventory\\n\\n- 3790223028: preserve append-only pm-th6y cleanup history; record that repeated array-shifting removals are current pm mutation granularity.\\n- 3790223031: replace the mutating hosted-workflow linked test with a non-mutating inspection command while retaining run 31906155419 in comments.\\n- 3790223032: deduplicate Bash history-author global completion candidates.\\n- 3790223034: compare normalized replacement payloads, not only successful exit codes.\\n- 3790223036: restore the shared readFile spy after each acknowledgment-plan test.\\n\\n## Guardrails\\n\\nUse pm for every tracker mutation, never rewrite append-only history, do not weaken replacement semantics or platform ratchets, and rerun bot review after every pushed amendment."
